{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365012-tc-aeon-detecting-novas-and-psions","id":1365012,"title":"TC Aeon - Detecting Novas and Psions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-03T08:20:21-08:00","id":1365012,"title":"TC Aeon - Detecting Novas and Psions","content":"Are there devices that can detect a nova or psions?<br /> <br /> Also, I was trying to find out how people are tested for psion potential and given access to a chamber. I may have missed this somewhere.<br /> <br /> the Aeonexpansion goes over the process in Nippon, what about elsewhere.<br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/686-ebonshadow","name":"Ebonshadow","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T10:09:36-08:00","id":1365044,"title":"","content":"Supposedly, since the Chinese seemed to have a way to know when most of the Aberrants has left Earth after their nuclear ultimatum. Of course there were a few left on Earth afterwards (especially in corruption zones and deep underwater), so either their sensors weren't perfect/lacked comprehensive global coverage, or they didn't have sensors at all and were lying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T10:10:24-08:00","id":1365046,"title":"","content":"Novas and Psions can be detected by Biotech items that use be basic power of Quantakinesis, Vitakinesis or Clairsentience.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s is not properly described, but it\u2019s possible to understand it from the texts. It\u2019s also possible that they use Psions with those powers to that end.<br /> <br /> Nippon relies on hard tech to everything, so they have no access to any way to detect Psions and Latents, but they have lots of technologies derived from Nova Tech, and so can use those to detect Novas, but those are rare items in general..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T12:15:57-08:00","id":1365075,"title":"","content":"Ok how are new psion latents discovered and how do they decide which of the chambers they get exposed to? Is there genetic testing like Nippon to sort out people with the potential?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/686-ebonshadow","name":"Ebonshadow","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T14:15:13-08:00","id":1365108,"title":"","content":"People go after latency tests, usually in the order they want to join or Aeon Trinity. If they have positive results they can ask for the order for a different chamber or the order chamber (in game terms, you just pick any one).<br /> <br /> The generic marking for Novas, Psiads (including psions) and Talents is virtually the same, and it don\u2019t differentiate if it\u2019s active or not yet, so a latent a Psion and a nova will have the same result in the test. The method to detect latency is not genetic, is noetic, and it differentiate the kind and if it\u2019s active or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T00:14:30-08:00","id":1365181,"title":"","content":"This is incorrect. The genetic markers for psi or quantum potential is roughly the same, but latents have already made that genetic \u2018choice\u2019 and headed down the psionic pathway. Unfortunately for them, they won\u2019t get any further without a Prometheus Chamber. <br /> <br /> As for how latents are identified - \u2018 psions can be detected by a simple and fast DNA test using blood, shed skin cells, or hair\u2018. Latency centers are all over the place in most countries and offer the service for free. Which chamber they\u2019re then exposed to depends on the psi order who identified them, whether they have a noetic preference, and what the individual wants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T00:19:38-08:00","id":1365182,"title":"","content":"And answering the original question - devices (hardtech and biotech) exist that can sense active psi or quantum signatures within close range. Think of them like metal detectors, placed on entrances and such to pick up if a psion comes through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T01:56:35-08:00","id":1365196,"title":"","content":"Genetically, eximorphs (quantum-users) and psychomorphs (psi-users) come from the same basic genetic sequence, but Talents can't be pinned down so easily. Sometimes -- like during the Nakamura process -- the process that generates an eximorph might instead give rise to a Talent instead, which may suggest a genetic link. But you'll find just as many (if not more) Talents who don't have that particular sequence.<br /> <br /> Otherwise yes, there's a genetic switch or fork, and a number of factors could cause that switch to flip either to quantum or psi. It's more complicated than that, obviously: there are two general noetic branches: psiads and latents. Latents <i>would</i> be a sort of evolutionary dead-end for noetic ability, except for the Prometheus Chambers. You may think it curious that the Doyen built the Chambers to work on latents instead of psiads, but latents are probably more numerous.<br /> <br /> Did you know biologists estimate that the eye has evolved over 50 times? I wonder what latents would look like in the fullness of time...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365012-tc-aeon-detecting-novas-and-psions?p=1365182#post1365182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And answering the original question - devices (hardtech and biotech) exist that can sense active psi or quantum signatures within close range. Think of them like metal detectors, placed on entrances and such to pick up if a psion comes through.</div> </div> </div> </div>And of course these methods aren't foolproof. Dormed-down novas, quantakinetics, and psiads may not register, depending on the quality of the detector and the method used.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T03:02:08-08:00","id":1365203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365012-tc-aeon-detecting-novas-and-psions?p=1365196#post1365196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And of course these methods aren't foolproof. Dormed-down novas, quantakinetics, and psiads may not register, depending on the quality of the detector and the method used.</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolutely! Didn\u2019t mean to suggest otherwise. <br /> <br /> If Storyguides/players are after rules for detecting psi/Quantum through these devices, I\u2019d suggest looking at the rules for detecting cyberware in the AEon AExpansion (pp. 18-19) for inspiration. Decide on the quality of the scanner to provide any Enhancement to the detection roll, and the state of what\u2019s being detected as the Complication. Dormed-down novas or masquerading Quantakinetics might be +5 Complication, whereas a psion with several active powers might be 0 Complication/Difficulty, or even give Enhancement to the psi detector!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T03:33:23-08:00","id":1365207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365012-tc-aeon-detecting-novas-and-psions?p=1365181#post1365181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is incorrect. The genetic markers for psi or quantum potential is roughly the same, but latents have already made that genetic \u2018choice\u2019 and headed down the psionic pathway. Unfortunately for them, they won\u2019t get any further without a Prometheus Chamber.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not questioning your answer, but I didn\u2019t get where I got it wrong. Of course Talents are not in the list (that was wrong), but when I said it didn\u2019t differentiate if it is active or not I didn\u2019t mean a Latent isn't active, I mean a Nova and a not yet erupted nova will mark as the same, and a Psiad, knowing or not will be the same as a Psion or a latent.<br /> <br /> Anyway, the idea of mirror the rules for detecting cyberware to detect psi/quantum is really interesting. I was planning to use it to detect Quantum tech in my Aberrant game, but you gave me more ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T03:38:27-08:00","id":1365208,"title":"","content":"Now a related question: what about the other powered people (the kind that can handle energy but not capable of storing it, Aexpansion page 82), they don\u2019t have the latency mark, but have something in common with the active powered people.<br /> <br /> As the method of detection is by detecting energy, they will not show in the scan, but what about the genetics? They will not have the latency but will have the thing that differentiate a Psion from a latent. Is there a way to detect them?<br /> <br /> i know nobody is looking for them, but if they did, do you think that\u2019s the way?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 02-04-2020, 06:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T04:10:38-08:00","id":1365215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365012-tc-aeon-detecting-novas-and-psions?p=1365108#post1365108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so a latent a Psion and a nova will have the same result in the test.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here\u2019s the error. They won\u2019t.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T04:29:35-08:00","id":1365220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365012-tc-aeon-detecting-novas-and-psions?p=1365215#post1365215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Here\u2019s the error. They won\u2019t.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was talking about the genetic test Nippon uses to detect possible novas, but I got it.<br /> <br /> Is the latency test a straight genetic test or does it use biotech to detect more then the genes from the sample?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T04:42:16-08:00","id":1365224,"title":"","content":"Ah, thought you were referring to the latency test. <br /> <br /> The latency test is DNA testing in the first instance, possibly followed by other equipment to sense any strengths if that proves positive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T09:43:58-08:00","id":1365282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365012-tc-aeon-detecting-novas-and-psions?p=1365196#post1365196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Genetically, eximorphs (quantum-users) and psychomorphs (psi-users) come from the same basic genetic sequence, but Talents can't be pinned down so easily. Sometimes -- like during the Nakamura process -- the process that generates an eximorph might instead give rise to a Talent instead, which may suggest a genetic link. But you'll find just as many (if not more) Talents who don't have that particular sequence.<br /> <br /> Otherwise yes, there's a genetic switch or fork, and a number of factors could cause that switch to flip either to quantum or psi. It's more complicated than that, obviously: there are two general noetic branches: psiads and latents. Latents <i>would</i> be a sort of evolutionary dead-end for noetic ability, except for the Prometheus Chambers. You may think it curious that the Doyen built the Chambers to work on latents instead of psiads, but latents are probably more numerous.<br /> <br /> Did you know biologists estimate that the eye has evolved over 50 times? I wonder what latents would look like in the fullness of time...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> And of course these methods aren't foolproof. Dormed-down novas, quantakinetics, and psiads may not register, depending on the quality of the detector and the method used.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for dropping that little tidbit, because it brought me to this really neat article!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://cosmosmagazine.com/biology/all-eyes-on-the-prize\" target=\"_blank\">https://cosmosmagazine.com/biology/a...s-on-the-prize</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}